WEBVTT

1
00:00.000 --> 00:05.500
Welcome to learningAI, the comprehensive, zero-cost AI education platform built for K through 12.

2
00:05.500 --> 00:11.200
For decades, machine learning has been treated like black magic locked behind expensive cloud data centers.

3
00:11.200 --> 00:18.000
learningAI changes everything. By executing real Python code directly inside the student's browser with WebAssembly,

4
00:18.000 --> 00:25.000
and training computer vision models locally with TensorFlow.js, learningAI guarantees zero compute costs,

5
00:25.000 --> 00:32.000
complete student privacy, and lightning-fast feedback on any Chromebook, laptop, or tablet.

6
00:32.000 --> 00:38.500
From curious six-year-olds in The Sandbox discovering pattern recognition,

7
00:38.500 --> 00:46.000
to high school seniors fine-tuning local open-source large language models, this is the future of AI literacy.

